    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f251f1914368ea64f8d13f52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在战斗漫画里就是○○武斗大会！\n在运动漫画里就是全国大会！\n虽然多以淘汰赛形式闻名――",
      "source_fingerprint": "882b7464f673cba8f535389cc56f88050a1827b07316b9cd983ef58fdc7a16df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137102.json",
      "json_path": [
