    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e32c8e36f59bd3610f264f11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "换言之，这与作为春季总决算的『宝冢纪念』\n在结构上颇有相似之处！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a663e335586b863a89eed9c13153686740e47299060382e7b12f325ac9f42361",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
