      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此在『大阪杯』『天皇赏（春）』等\n春季GⅠ中活跃的强者们将齐聚一堂。\n……也就是说～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3fd4aadca36223ca293e44e47100c1893ba6a38836993b005217e4c865a15af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
