    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07f0c3b284f7a1888d849283",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对吧！？\n原本这就是颇受赛马娘瞩目的比赛。\n即便不做特别安排也会集结强者们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e1db02953522e0447777db788b473e504ff0f3cafabffd355e3af1c4fc5da97",
